Package: crnp
Type: Package
Title: Coverage-Robust Projection of Fixed Protein Networks
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Yuxi", "Mao", email = "3493118903@qq.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Projects a source-defined, fixed-weight protein network score into
    target assays with incomplete structural protein coverage. The method uses
    robust source protein correlations, source-only regularization, and a
    coverage-adaptive recovery rule without selecting proteins or estimating
    weights from target phenotypes. Utilities audit protein mappings, aggregate
    multiple assay features, compare frozen projection methods, and evaluate
    known-answer coverage loss.
